# API Contract: Audio Processing Operations

## Purpose
Define the API contract for audio processing operations (recording, conversion, trimming, metadata)

## Version
1.0.0

## Base URL
`tauri://api` (for Tauri-bound operations)

## Endpoints

### POST /audio/record-to-text
**Description**: Convert audio recording to text
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "audioFilePath": "string",
  "options": {
    "language": "string (e.g., en-US, zh-CN)",
    "punctuation": "boolean",
    "profanityFilter": "boolean"
  }
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "status": "completed | processing | failed",
  "transcript": "string",
  "progress": "number",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

### POST /audio/trim
**Description**: Trim audio file by selecting segments
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "inputPath": "string",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "segments": [
    {
      "startTime": "number (seconds)",
      "endTime": "number (seconds)"
    }
  ],
  "options": {
    "crossfade": "boolean",
    "preserveOriginal": "boolean"
  }
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "status": "completed | processing | failed",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "progress": "number",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

### POST /audio/convert
**Description**: Convert audio between different formats
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "inputPath": "string",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "targetFormat": "mp3 | wav | flac | ogg",
  "options": {
    "bitrate": "number (kbps)",
    "sampleRate": "number (hz)",
    "channels": "number"
  }
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "status": "completed | processing | failed",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "metadata": {
    "format": "string",
    "sampleRate": "number",
    "bitRate": "number",
    "duration": "number",
    "channels": "number"
  },
  "progress": "number",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

### POST /audio/merge
**Description**: Merge multiple audio files in sequence
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "inputPaths": "Array<string>",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "options": {
    "alignSampleRates": "boolean",
    "addCrossfades": "boolean",
    "preserveOriginalOrder": "boolean"
  }
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "status": "completed | processing | failed",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "mergedCount": "number",
  "progress": "number",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

### POST /audio/volume-adjust
**Description**: Adjust volume with fade-in/fade-out effects
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "inputPath": "string",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "options": {
    "gain": "number (0.0-2.0, where 1.0 is no change)",
    "fadeInDuration": "number (seconds)",
    "fadeOutDuration": "number (seconds)"
  }
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "status": "completed | processing | failed",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "progress": "number",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

### POST /audio/metadata
**Description**: Extract metadata from audio file
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "inputPath": "string"
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "fileId": "string",
  "format": "string",
  "sampleRate": "number",
  "bitRate": "number",
  "duration": "number",
  "channels": "number",
  "size": "number",
  "additionalMetadata": "object"
}
```

### GET /audio/waveform
**Description**: Generate waveform data for visualization
**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "inputPath": "string",
  "options": {
    "peaksCount": "number (default: 2000)",
    "channels": "number (default: 1)"
  }
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "waveform": "Array<number>",
  "duration": "number",
  "sampleRate": "number"
}
```

### GET /audio/job/{jobId}
**Description**: Get status of an audio processing job
**Response**:
```json
{
  "jobId": "string",
  "taskType": "string",
  "status": "string",
  "progress": "number",
  "outputPath": "string",
  "error": "string | null"
}
```

## Error Responses
All endpoints follow the standard error format:
```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "string",
    "message": "string",
    "details": "object"
  }
}
```

## Security
- All file system operations require proper Tauri permission configuration
- Audio file validation to prevent malicious processing
- Memory management critical for large audio files
- Process execution for ffmpeg operations properly sandboxed